{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221360","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221360","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322136001:1":{"text":"卡列琳娜，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>……还有两位修士先生，你们来找我，一定是为了净化活死人的事情吧。","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，<style=stress><player_...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E168392FAD2D2A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"卡列琳娜，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>……还有两位修士先生，你们来找我，一定是为了净化活死人的事情吧。","female":"卡列琳娜，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>……还有两位修士先生，你们来找我，一定是为了净化活死人的事情吧。","variant_male_record_index":"149378","variant_female_record_index":"149379","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322136002:1":{"text":"是的，瓦丽卡姐姐。这两位是奥格列修士和马克西姆修士，他们同意配合我们，试着用圣光净化活死人。","source_cn":"是的，瓦丽卡姐姐。这两位是奥格列修士和马克西姆修士，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C760EEC4CC3C6E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322136003:1":{"text":"太好了！我代表那些战士感谢你们的帮助。","source_cn":"太好了！我代表那些战士感谢你们的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0A9F2B70FC9CE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322136004:1":{"text":"你……你是……艾雅在上，你是冬日祭典纪念的那位、那位打败了恶魔的英雄！","source_cn":"你……你是……艾雅在上，你是冬日祭典纪念的那位、那位打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF13997AA36FC25C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322136005:1":{"text":"那些都是过去的事情了。冰之恶魔已